{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55498","headline":"和表弟包颖见寄 · 徐铉","name":"和表弟包颖见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生中表最情亲，浮世那堪聚散频。\n谢眺却吟归省阁，刘桢犹自卧漳滨。\n旧游半是前生事，要路多达後进人。\n且喜新吟报强健，明年相望杏园春。\n（《徐公文集》卷三。\n）（按：《徐公文集》卷三收《表弟包颖见寄》，爲包颖寄徐铉之作；其次爲和诗一首，爲徐铉和包颖之作。\n《全唐诗》误以包颖诗收徐铉名下，而以徐和诗录归包颖名下。\n今爲分别移正之。\n此则参《文史》二十五辑曹汛先生文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}